  m_Name: New QR Code Data 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: Kontrol ve Koruma Paneli
  title: Kontrol ve Koruma Paneli
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Kontrol ve Koruma Paneli, test arac\u0131n\u0131n \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma
    durumu ve g\xFCvenlik ko\u015Fullar\u0131n\u0131 izlemek i\xE7in kullan\u0131l\u0131r.
    Panel \xFCzerindeki g\xF6sterge lambalar\u0131; topraklama d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC,
    arka kap\u0131n\u0131n a\xE7\u0131k veya kapal\u0131 olmas\u0131, acil durdurma
    (Emergency Stop) durumu ve di\u011Fer koruma fonksiyonlar\u0131n\u0131n anl\u0131k
    durumunu g\xF6sterir. Sistem, g\xFCvenlik \u015Fartlar\u0131ndan herhangi biri
    sa\u011Flanmad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda test ekipman\u0131n\u0131n enerjilendirilmesini
    engelleyerek g\xFCvenli \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma ortam\u0131n\u0131n korunmas\u0131na
    yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. B\xF6ylece operat\xF6r, test \xF6ncesinde t\xFCm g\xFCvenlik
    kontrollerini tek panel \xFCzerinden kolayca takip edebilir."
